ges/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-3b3338651bbebb9cEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-cf8cd31109b5031fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GLO_GeneralLoreBook_HelmDogmaLore</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_GeneralLoreBook_HelmDogmaLore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_GeneralLoreBook_HelmDogmaLore\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">f407421a-e778-44d6-a9fa-5cb5f82577e5</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f407421a-e778-44d6-a9fa-5cb5f82577e5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f407421a-e778-44d6-a9fa-5cb5f82577e5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;116&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-23</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[In this text you come across the bull-necked, hard-spined doctrines of the God Helm as transcribed and interpreted by a <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a> called Thou Shalt Not Suffer The Doom Herring To Live O'Reilly. He chose that name after being convinced that the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Xanathar\">Xanathar</a> organisation was not led by a many-eyed <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/beholder\">beholder</a> monster, but by something called a doom herring. The doctrines are the usual religious fare, only mildly distinguished by Helm's focus on the provision of protection to those who need it, forming a shield of steel as well as sympathy for the meek and downtrodden.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715021646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1382/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27001/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8122/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935663/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.633      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.633      1 -total\n 48.96%   19.404      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.48%   17.233     15 Template:Trim\n 23.56%    9.336      2 Template:Uid\n 15.81%    6.265      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.96%    5.533      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.55%    4.